  "vetSays": [
    {
      "day": 8,
      "line": "🛡️ Addison, Rowan, Kyle and Taine met them at the door — 4 put down. Addison, Rowan, Taine are hurt."
    },
    {
      "day": 26,
      "line": "⚠ This one is different — old, patient, unhurried — it has seen your kind before. An Elder veteran."
    },
    {
      "day": 26,
      "line": "The Elder Nevermore falls."
    },
    {
      "day": 26,
      "line": "📺 +20 style — dropped the Elder Nevermore!"
    },
    {
      "day": 27,
      "line": "📺 \"Oh, you survived the AUDIENCE NOTES? Cute. We've stopped pretending these are animals now. That was the FINAL DRAFT, folks — what comes out of the treeline next was never alive the way you mean it.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 27,
      "line": "🛡️ Addison, Kyle, Taine, Otto and Hassan met them at the door — 5 put down. Addison, Kyle, Taine, Otto, Hassan are hurt."
    },
    {
      "day": 33,
      "line": "⚠ This one is different — scarred, braced, waiting for your opening. A Scarred veteran."
    },
    {
      "day": 33,
      "line": "It saw the opening coming — braced, scar tissue white. Your first strike glances off. (SCARRED: -3 first strike)"
    },
    {
      "day": 33,
      "line": "The Scarred Big Loud falls."
    },
    {
      "day": 33,
      "line": "📺 +20 style — dropped the Scarred Big Loud!"
    },
    {
      "day": 36,
      "line": "🛡️ Addison, Kyle, Taine, Otto and Hassan met them at the door — 5 put down. Addison, Kyle, Taine, Otto, Hassan are hurt."
    },
    {
      "day": 41,
      "line": "📺 \"We've been watching you for a LONG time. Your faiths. Your formats. Your little institutions. So we built something out of... well. Out of YOU. Say hello to the MIRROR DRAFT.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 41,
      "line": "⚠ This one is different — scarred, braced, waiting for your opening. A Scarred veteran."
    },
    {
      "day": 41,
      "line": "Petra strikes the Scarred Mister Never."
    },
    {
      "day": 41,
      "line": "It saw the opening coming — braced, scar tissue white. Your first strike glances off. (SCARRED: -3 first strike)"
    },
    {
      "day": 41,
      "line": "The Scarred Mister Never falls."
    },
    {
      "day": 41,
      "line": "📺 +20 style — dropped the Scarred Mister Never!"
    },
    {
      "day": 48,
      "line": "⚠ This one is different — bigger, and it didn't come alone. A Pack-leader veteran."
    },
    {
      "day": 48,
      "line": "⚠️ 1 threats: Pack-leader Sweeps Week (×2) — all here, all now.\nYour party: just you. You are outnumbered — fight like it."
    },
    {
      "day": 48,
      "line": "The Pack-leader Sweeps Week falls."
    },
    {
      "day": 48,
      "line": "📺 +20 style — dropped the Pack-leader Sweeps Week!"
    },
    {
      "day": 48,
      "line": "🛡️ Addison, Rowan, Kyle, Taine and Otto met them at the door — 4 put down, 1 barely walked away. Addison, Kyle, Taine, Otto are hurt."
    },
    {
      "day": 55,
      "line": "◈ SYSTEM: \"Four waves. FOUR. The producers are — okay, I'm saying it: FINALES need a NATION. You've got a region; now make it a REALM. Bind fires under one head, or bend the knee to someone who has. The higher-ups are watching. ...Did I say higher-ups? I said NOTHING. Forget the higher-ups.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 55,
      "line": "◈ ARC IV — THE INEFFICIENCY. SYSTEM: \"ROUNDING ERROR RECLASSIFIED: ANOMALY. Organic consumption yields impossible output. Recalculating. Recalculating.\" — They finally see it. The thing they laughed at — needing to EAT — is the engine. Their confusion is your weapon now. You stood up to the calibration fauna, the audience's notes, the Final Draft — lived through their Show, weathered the worst together, and built something bigger than a village. One day humanity will need a case to make. The case is made of deeds, not words — and yours, though unfinished, are undeniable. (Feasted buffs burn ho"
    },
    {
      "day": 56,
      "line": "📺 \"But finales — FINALES need a LEGEND, sweetheart. More STANDING — blood, bonds, or bread — and look the Mirror Draft in the eye. The producers are WAITING.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 59,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Petra just put down Don't-Look... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 71,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Cauã just put down Chorus Line... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 109,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Cheyenne just put down The Herald... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 109,
      "line": "🛡️ Cheyenne, James and Suresh met them at the door — 2 put down, 1 barely walked away. Cheyenne, James, Suresh are hurt."
    },
    {
      "day": 110,
      "line": "James: \"Cheyenne and Kyle blooded the fourth draft's beasts — we all saw it on the cameras. But only 5 of us carry a weapon, and the fifth draft waits until 6 of us do. We need more hands armed, not more speeches.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 112,
      "line": "★ IDENTIFIED: European Elder. Elder. Big shrub; flat white flower plates in June, drooping black berry clusters in late summer. Uses unknown — harvest, taste, and learn."
    },
    {
      "day": 112,
      "line": "Suresh was watching. Now they know European Elder too."
    },
    {
      "day": 113,
      "line": "The fire burns low. One new line in the journal: European Elder — named and noted."
    }
  ],
