      "day": 1,
      "line": "A person, maybe 40s, with a burn-scarred forearm hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 1,
      "line": "A person, maybe 40s, with a burn-scarred forearm heads out for water. \"Off to the well — back with a full skin.\" The pantry won't fill itself."
    },
    {
      "day": 1,
      "line": "A man, maybe 30s, with a scarred cheek heads out for water. \"The well won't fill itself.\" The pantry won't fill itself."
    },
    {
      "day": 1,
      "line": "📋 A person, maybe 40s, with a burn-scarred forearm — 💧 Fetch water. They'll report back by next part."
    },
    {
