      "line": "A person, maybe 40s, with a burn-scarred forearm hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 1,
      "line": "💧 A person, maybe 40s, with a burn-scarred forearm returns with water: +2 clean."
    },
    {
      "day": 1,
      "line": "A person, maybe 40s, with a burn-scarred forearm will work the garden once each day while at Haven. Other orders take priority."
    },
    {
      "day": 1,
      "line": "🌱 A person, maybe 40s, with a burn-scarred forearm looks over the garden: turned soil, nothing planted. Someone has to sow first."
    },
    {
      "day": 1,
      "line": "💧 A man, maybe 30s, with a scarred cheek returns with water: +2 clean."
    },
    {
      "day": 1,
      "line": "A person, maybe 40s, with a burn-scarred forearm and A woman, maybe 50s, with a missing fingertip are comparing scars like trading cards."
    },
    {
      "day": 1,
      "line": "📓 Journal: the person in their 40s, with a burn-scarred forearm taught the man in his 30s, with a slouched posture Reading Tracks."
    },
    {
      "day": 2,
      "line": "📋 A person, maybe 40s, with a burn-scarred forearm — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."
    },
    {
      "day": 2,
      "line": "A man, maybe 30s, with a scarred cheek hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 2,
      "line": "...and then it lands: A man, maybe 30s, with a scarred cheek speaks 🇺🇸 English. A few shared words. Gestures. Patience."
    },
    {
      "day": 9,
      "line": "🛡️ Isabella, Esperanza, Ursula and Vitaly met them at the door — 4 put down. Isabella, Esperanza, Ursula, Vitaly are hurt."
    },
    {
      "day": 20,
      "line": "🛡️ Isabella, Esperanza, Ursula and Vitaly met them at the door — 4 put down. Esperanza, Ursula, Vitaly are hurt."
    },
    {
      "day": 25,
      "line": "📺 \"Oh, you survived the AUDIENCE NOTES? Cute. We've stopped pretending these are animals now. That was the FINAL DRAFT, folks — what comes out of the treeline next was never alive the way you mean it.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 28,
      "line": "🛡️ Isabella, Vitaly, Yara, Giulia and Mara met them at the door — 4 put down, 1 driven off. Vitaly, Giulia are hurt."
    },
    {
      "day": 37,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Vitaly just put down The Terms of Service... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 37,
      "line": "🛡️ Esperanza, Ursula, Vitaly, Yara and Mara met them at the door — 2 put down, 3 driven off. Esperanza, Vitaly, Yara, Mara are hurt."
    },
    {
      "day": 44,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Isabella just put down Spool... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 46,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Isabella just put down Ad Break... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 46,
      "line": "🛡️ Vitaly, Yara, Mara, Jesse and Olivia met them at the door — 4 put down, 1 driven off. Yara, Mara, Jesse, Olivia are hurt."
    },
    {
      "day": 51,
      "line": "📺 \"We've been watching you for a LONG time. Your faiths. Your formats. Your little institutions. So we built something out of... well. Out of YOU. Say hello to the MIRROR DRAFT.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 64,
      "line": "◈ SYSTEM: \"Four waves. FOUR. The producers are — okay, I'm saying it: FINALES need a NATION. You've got a region; now make it a REALM. Bind fires under one head, or bend the knee to someone who has. The higher-ups are watching. ...Did I say higher-ups? I said NOTHING. Forget the higher-ups.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 64,
      "line": "◈ ARC IV — THE INEFFICIENCY. SYSTEM: \"ROUNDING ERROR RECLASSIFIED: ANOMALY. Organic consumption yields impossible output. Recalculating. Recalculating.\" — They finally see it. The thing they laughed at — needing to EAT — is the engine. Their confusion is your weapon now. You stood up to the calibration fauna, the audience's notes, the Final Draft — lived through their Show, weathered the worst together, and built something bigger than a village. One day humanity will need a case to make. The case is made of deeds, not words — and yours, though unfinished, are undeniable. (Feasted buffs burn ho"
    },
    {
      "day": 65,
      "line": "📺 \"But finales — FINALES need a LEGEND, sweetheart. More STANDING — blood, bonds, or bread — and look the Mirror Draft in the eye. The producers are WAITING.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 140,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Aiman just put down The Big Beast... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    }
