  "vetSays": [
    {
      "day": 1,
      "line": "A person, maybe 30s, with a burn-scarred forearm heads out for water. \"Off to the well — back with a full skin.\" The pantry won't fill itself."
    },
    {
      "day": 1,
      "line": "💧 A person, maybe 30s, with a burn-scarred forearm returns with water: +4 clean."
    },
    {
      "day": 2,
      "line": "A person, maybe 30s, with a burn-scarred forearm looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 2,
      "line": "A person, maybe 30s, with a burn-scarred forearm hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 2,
      "line": "\"Can we talk?\" A person, maybe 30s, with a burn-scarred forearm sits down near you. \"Just... talk. Like people used to.\" (Talk to A person, maybe 30s, with a burn-scarred forearm.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 2,
      "line": "👂 Overheard — A person, maybe 30s, with a burn-scarred forearm: \"One day at a time. We're still here — that counts.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 2,
      "line": "A person, maybe 30s, with a burn-scarred forearm heads out for water. \"The well won't fill itself.\" The pantry won't fill itself."
    },
    {
      "day": 2,
      "line": "A person, maybe 30s, with a burn-scarred forearm hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 2,
      "line": "💧 A person, maybe 30s, with a burn-scarred forearm returns with water: +3 clean."
    },
    {
      "day": 2,
      "line": "A person, maybe 30s, with a burn-scarred forearm traded something with someone for something else. The barter economy stirs."
    },
    {
      "day": 3,
      "line": "You catch fragments by the fire — Owen telling A person, maybe 30s, with a burn-scarred forearm about you. The retelling is already better than the event."
    },
    {
      "day": 3,
      "line": "A person, maybe 30s, with a burn-scarred forearm heads out for water. \"Thirst doesn't negotiate. Going.\" Better close to the fire today."
    },
    {
      "day": 3,
      "line": "You catch fragments by the fire — Vasyl telling A woman, maybe 20s, with a shaved head about A person, maybe 30s, with a burn-scarred forearm. It's barely the same story now. That's what fires do."
    },
    {
      "day": 3,
      "line": "You catch fragments by the fire — A person, maybe 30s, with a burn-scarred forearm telling Vasyl about you. The truth left this story two fires ago. What's left is better theater."
    },
    {
      "day": 3,
      "line": "💧 A person, maybe 30s, with a burn-scarred forearm returns with water: +4 clean."
    },
    {
      "day": 3,
      "line": "A person, maybe 30s, with a burn-scarred forearm traded something with someone for something else. The barter economy stirs."
    },
    {
      "day": 4,
      "line": "📋 A person, maybe 30s, with a burn-scarred forearm — 🪾 Gather deadfall. They'll report back by next part."
    },
    {
      "day": 4,
      "line": "...and then it lands: A person, maybe 30s, with a burn-scarred forearm speaks 🇸🇦 Arabic. You share no language at all."
    },
    {
      "day": 8,
      "line": "🛡️ Morris, Christian, Luke and Moritz met them at the door — 4 put down. Morris, Christian, Luke, Moritz are hurt."
    },
    {
      "day": 15,
      "line": "🛡️ Morris, Christian, Luke and Moritz met them at the door — 4 put down. Morris, Christian, Luke, Moritz are hurt."
    },
    {
      "day": 25,
      "line": "📺 \"Oh, you survived the AUDIENCE NOTES? Cute. We've stopped pretending these are animals now. That was the FINAL DRAFT, folks — what comes out of the treeline next was never alive the way you mean it.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 31,
      "line": "🛡️ Morris, Christian, Luke and Moritz met them at the door — 1 put down, 1 driven off, 1 barely walked away. Morris didn't come back. Christian, Luke, Moritz are hurt."
    },
    {
      "day": 39,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Monique just put down The Callback... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 39,
      "line": "🛡️ Christian, Luke, Moritz and Monique met them at the door — 2 put down, 2 driven off. Christian, Luke are hurt."
    },
    {
      "day": 46,
      "line": "🛡️ Luke, Moritz and Yara met them at the door — 2 put down, 1 driven off. Luke, Moritz, Yara are hurt."
    },
    {
      "day": 56,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Luke just put down Buffering... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 56,
      "line": "🛡️ Christian, Luke, Monique, Thabo and Owen met them at the door — 3 put down, 1 driven off, 1 barely walked away. Luke, Monique, Thabo, Owen are hurt."
    },
    {
      "day": 57,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Luke just put down Spool... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 65,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Thabo just put down The Big Beast... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 65,
      "line": "📺 \"We've been watching you for a LONG time. Your faiths. Your formats. Your little institutions. So we built something out of... well. Out of YOU. Say hello to the MIRROR DRAFT.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 65,
      "line": "🛡️ Christian, Luke, Moritz, Monique and Thabo met them at the door — 4 put down, 1 driven off. Luke, Monique are hurt."
    },
    {
      "day": 73,
      "line": "◈ SYSTEM: \"Four waves. FOUR. The producers are — okay, I'm saying it: FINALES need a NATION. You've got a region; now make it a REALM. Bind fires under one head, or bend the knee to someone who has. The higher-ups are watching. ...Did I say higher-ups? I said NOTHING. Forget the higher-ups.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 73,
      "line": "◈ ARC IV — THE INEFFICIENCY. SYSTEM: \"ROUNDING ERROR RECLASSIFIED: ANOMALY. Organic consumption yields impossible output. Recalculating. Recalculating.\" — They finally see it. The thing they laughed at — needing to EAT — is the engine. Their confusion is your weapon now. You stood up to the calibration fauna, the audience's notes, the Final Draft — lived through their Show, weathered the worst together, and built something bigger than a village. One day humanity will need a case to make. The case is made of deeds, not words — and yours, though unfinished, are undeniable. (Feasted buffs burn ho"
    },
    {
      "day": 74,
      "line": "📺 \"But finales — FINALES need a LEGEND, sweetheart. More STANDING — blood, bonds, or bread — and look the Mirror Draft in the eye. The producers are WAITING.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 107,
      "line": "⚠ This one is different — bigger, and it didn't come alone. A Pack-leader veteran."
