  "vetSays": [
    {
      "day": 7,
      "line": "🛡️ the person in their 40s, Dorothy, the person in their 50s, with deep-set eyes and Vsevolod met them at the door — 4 put down. the person in their 40s, Dorothy, the person in their 50s, with deep-set eyes, Vsevolod are hurt."
    },
    {
      "day": 15,
      "line": "🛡️ Dorothy, Alex, Vsevolod and Florencia met them at the door — 4 put down. Dorothy, Alex, Vsevolod are hurt."
    },
    {
      "day": 28,
      "line": "📺 \"Oh, you survived the AUDIENCE NOTES? Cute. We've stopped pretending these are animals now. That was the FINAL DRAFT, folks — what comes out of the treeline next was never alive the way you mean it.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 29,
      "line": "🛡️ Dorothy, Alex, Nino and Dale met them at the door — 3 put down. Nino didn't come back. Dorothy, Dale are hurt."
    },
    {
      "day": 31,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Dorothy just put down The Terms of Service... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 36,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Nina just put down The Redactor... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 36,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Mateo just put down Spool... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 36,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Dorothy just put down The Redactor... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 36,
      "line": "📺 \"We've been watching you for a LONG time. Your faiths. Your formats. Your little institutions. So we built something out of... well. Out of YOU. Say hello to the MIRROR DRAFT.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 36,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Vsevolod just put down The Callback... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 36,
      "line": "🛡️ Dorothy, Alex, Vsevolod and Florencia met them at the door — 4 put down. Alex, Vsevolod, Florencia are hurt."
    },
    {
      "day": 65,
      "line": "◈ SYSTEM: \"Four waves. FOUR. The producers are — okay, I'm saying it: FINALES need a NATION. You've got a region; now make it a REALM. Bind fires under one head, or bend the knee to someone who has. The higher-ups are watching. ...Did I say higher-ups? I said NOTHING. Forget the higher-ups.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 65,
      "line": "◈ ARC IV — THE INEFFICIENCY. SYSTEM: \"ROUNDING ERROR RECLASSIFIED: ANOMALY. Organic consumption yields impossible output. Recalculating. Recalculating.\" — They finally see it. The thing they laughed at — needing to EAT — is the engine. Their confusion is your weapon now. You stood up to the calibration fauna, the audience's notes, the Final Draft — lived through their Show, weathered the worst together, and built something bigger than a village. One day humanity will need a case to make. The case is made of deeds, not words — and yours, though unfinished, are undeniable. (Feasted buffs burn ho"
    },
    {
      "day": 66,
      "line": "📺 \"But finales — FINALES need a LEGEND, sweetheart. More STANDING — blood, bonds, or bread — and look the Mirror Draft in the eye. The producers are WAITING.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 73,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Henry just put down Ugly-Eyes... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 73,
      "line": "🛡️ Henry and Obonyo met them at the door — 1 put down, 1 barely walked away. Henry, Obonyo are hurt."
    }
